==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Doge]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
*2 [[H. Nah]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 40~43.33 seconds<sup>1,200f~1,300f</sup>.
*5 [[Otta-smack-u]]s spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 20~23.33 seconds<sup>600f~700f</sup>.

==Strategy==
While a very basic stage, fodder units capable of outranging H. Nah are recommended lest you wish to chip them down for an unnecessarily long amount of time.

